sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant AgentService as Agent Service
    participant Repository
    participant FileSelector as File Selector Agent
    participant DeepScan as Deep Scan Agents
    participant Models as Chinou Models
    participant Store as A2A Task Store

    User->>Frontend: Provide repository name and custom prompt
    Frontend->>AgentService: Start security scan

    AgentService->>Repository: Temporarily clone repository
    Repository-->>AgentService: Return repository files

    AgentService->>FileSelector: Select potentially vulnerable files
    FileSelector-->>AgentService: Return top 50 files

    loop For each selected file
        loop Run each security agent
            AgentService->>DeepScan: Analyze file using custom prompt
            Note over DeepScan: Recon Agent<br/>Taint Agent<br/>Patterns Agent<br/>Logic Agent<br/>Dependency Scan Agent
            DeepScan->>Models: Perform deep vulnerability analysis
            Models-->>DeepScan: Return findings
            DeepScan->>Store: Store agent artifacts
        end
    end

    AgentService-->>Frontend: Return final scan results
    Frontend-->>User: Display vulnerabilities